      "type": "text",
      "x": 1132,
      "y": 482,
      "strokeColor": "#0A0A0A",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "· 推进圈半径 200px，圈内攻方人数多才前进",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-11-01T11:49:09.930Z",
